WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.900
Yugi Muto assembled the Millennium Puzzle and became the guardian of the Shadow Games.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.260
Pegasus has a Millennium Item of his own - the Millennium Eye.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:21.800
Yugi accepts Pegasus's challenge and goes to Duelist Kingdom.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:27.940
Pegasus stole his grandfather Sugoroku's soul, and Yugi intends to rescue him.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:33.940
He battles alongside his trusted friends and with his other self.

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:44.300
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:51.210
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.960
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.660
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:09.760
You're on the other side of the table

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:13.130
I'm talking to you, but...

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:20.060
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.310
Even though I'm this close to you

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:33.580
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:40.320
What is truly precious?

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:49.490
Cut Through the Darkness!
Swords of Revealing Light

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.050
What card did you set?

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:06.670
Was it another trap card?

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:09.500
You still can't see it?

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:16.380
The flames of hell that will dispel the shadows aren't aimed at me.  They're aimed at you.

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:19.000
Ridiculous.  That's nonsense.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.670
I'm not lying.

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:27.160
In the shadows, the flames are burning stronger every turn, aiming for you.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:30.000
You have four turns left.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:35.130
What are you talking about?

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:39.150
Shadows are mirrors that reveal your fear.

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:41.640
Cowards will be overwhelmed.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:45.780
Don't you realize that you're the one in trouble?

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:53.650
It's your turn.  Draw a card.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:58.650
Yugi is using words to overwhelm his opponent.

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.700
Mai, this is his trump card?

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:03.040
Yes.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:07.950
Player Killer had the advantage in the shadows, but Yugi's words has thrown him off his game.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.200
He's being overwhelmed.

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:12.600
Well done, Yugi.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:14.400
What's the matter, big guy?

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.610
Can't you even draw a card?

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:19.380
You punk!

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:28.950
I drew my strongest card!

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:33.200
Come out, King of Yamimakai!

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:39.700
This is my trump card.

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:41.250
Too bad for you.

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:45.600
I'll kill you before you can play your trump card.

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.150
Yugi!

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:53.400
King of Yamimakai, attack his Curse of Dragon!

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.420
Magic Wave!

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.450
What?

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:17.400
Reaper of the Cards is destroyed.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.700
All right!

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:20.300
You did it, Yugi!

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:21.770
What?

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:28.200
Yugi used Spellbinding Circle to make my monsters destroy each other.

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.950
He planned that from the start.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:33.920
Too bad.  My monster is unharmed.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:35.290
It's my turn.

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:37.990
I'll now use my trump card.

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:40.830
Here I go!  Swords of Revealing Light!

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:55.400
Stop it!

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:09.200
All right!  We can see the enemies!

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.330
The shadows are gone.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.330
Damn!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:20.000
You'll be defeated in three turns.

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:26.450
I didn't just reveal your monsters.

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:33.350
Swords of Revealing Light prevents your monsters from moving for three turns.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:38.400
That means you can't attack.

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:44.450
This is bad.  Yugi is going to attack my monsters on the next turn.

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:48.750
But he only has Curse of Dragon on his field.

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:55.300
I have three monsters on my field: Barox, Dark Chimera and King Of Yamimakai.

00:05:55.300 --> 00:06:00.350
Despite his Swords of Revealing Light, the Yami Field Power Source is still active.

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:06.110
Even if Curse of Dragon destroys Barox, that's not enough to defeat me.

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:10.000
It's your turn.  Hurry up and draw a card.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:17.290
But he might play a monster with high attack points on his next turn.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:19.430
I have to plan for that.

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:24.230
I drew a great card.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:30.370
Yugi, you can no longer defeat me in the remaining three turns.

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:33.100
Yellow Luster Shield!

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:41.650
That protective shield switches your monster to defense position and raises its defense points.

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:48.650
I activate Yellow Luster Shield by comboing it with Castle Of Dark Illusions.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:50.600
This is bad!

00:06:55.020 --> 00:07:03.940
His floating castle projects a shield over his monsters on the ground, raising their defense points.

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:05.200
Damn!

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:06.350
Oh no!

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:09.440
He won't be defeated that easily.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.250
My combo is complete.

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:26.550
I see.  That allowed him to raise his monsters' defense points.

00:07:28.700 --> 00:07:34.500
As long as I have Yellow Luster Shield, your monster doesn't have enough attack points to win.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:38.570
Do you still think you can defeat me in three turns?

00:07:38.570 --> 00:07:40.450
Well, kid?

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:47.700
Just when Yugi eliminated the shadows and immobilized his enemies, he raised their defense points.

00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:52.200
The Shadow Player Killer is completely focusing on defense.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:08:01.330
Yes.  Yugi is focused on offense, but he can't attack carelessly because his opponent's defense is strong.

00:08:01.550 --> 00:08:03.850
Can't he do anything?

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:06.100
Like what?

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:10.400
How will you break through this perfect defense, Yugi?

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:15.450
It's your turn.

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:22.610
You haven't realized that you revealed your weak point.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:26.750
What weak point?  You're saying that because you know you've lost.

00:08:26.750 --> 00:08:28.340
We'll see about that.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:30.590
What are you trying to say?

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:38.100
I've been analyzing your strategy since this duel began.

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:39.500
So what?

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:41.150
I said it before.

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:46.610
You're a hopeless coward, and you just proved it.

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:51.540
Be quiet!  No matter how many times you say it, I'm not a coward!

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:55.380
Yes, you are.  You're a cowardly thief.

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:06.500
I'm not a coward!

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:15.500
Hey.

00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:20.470
Don't forget that you only have two turns left.

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:40.020
I'll tell you one thing.

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:45.400
I expected you to use that Shield from the start.

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:49.700
Whatever!  Do you want another baptism of fire?

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:53.500
Stop it, Yugi!  Don't provoke him!

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:54.900
Calm down.

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:59.350
He's using words to try to get out of trouble.

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:01.700
Believe in him.

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:06.650
Stop bluffing!

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:08.800
I'm not bluffing.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:13.450
You can't do anything unless you feel perfectly secure.

00:10:13.450 --> 00:10:18.650
So it was easy to guess that a coward like you would create a shield.

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:20.800
Stop calling me a coward!

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:24.900
If you don't like being called a coward, then defeat me.

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:29.950
You only have two turns left.

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:36.620
What will you do, big guy?  Will you continue or give up?

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:39.000
How dare you say that, kid!

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:45.900
Fine.  I'll burn you to a crisp after I finish this duel.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:51.400
He got out of a tight spot, but the real battle is only beginning.

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:54.250
Here I go!  It's my turn!

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:57.770
I drew Gaia The Fierce Knight.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:09.500
You fool!  It doesn't have enough attack points to break through my impenetrable fortress!

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:13.190
I also activate the spell card that I set.

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:14.250
What?

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:15.950
This card is...

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:21.650
Polymerization!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:38.050
Gaia the Dragon Champion in attack position!

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:40.980
Gaia the Dragon Champion?

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:45.590
I end my turn, and you're finished as well.

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:49.700
Impossible.  I'm going to lose in this situation?

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:56.050
Even with Gaia the Dragon Champion's attack points, Yellow Luster Shield protects my monsters from attack.

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:58.650
He is definitely bluffing.

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:04.270
Why is he laughing?

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:11.700
If I survive his next attack, Swords of Revealing Light will vanish on my next turn.

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:18.750
Then if I remove Yellow Luster Shield and attack his monster, I win.

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:21.050
But I still should be careful.

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:23.500
It's my turn.

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:26.950
My card is Metal Guardian.

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:30.900
I place it in defense position to protect my monster army.

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:33.570
The Field Power Source powers it up.

00:12:33.570 --> 00:12:35.200
Now it's perfect.

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:39.250
It's 100% impossible to attack my monsters.

00:12:40.100 --> 00:12:42.840
Just like I thought, you're pathetic.

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:44.340
What?

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:49.080
You only think about protecting yourself.  You're too weak.

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:53.450
Be quiet!  When Swords of Revealing Light is gone, I'll be invincible!

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:54.850
I'll counterattack you!

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:59.050
It's too late.  You're already caught in my trap.

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:00.090
What?

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:04.300
The more you protect yourself, the less you can escape.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:07.600
Whatever!  You're nothing but talk!

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:11.950
Are you sure?  This is your last turn.

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:15.900
This is the end!

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:19.200
My card is Catapult Turtle!

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:29.360
Furthermore...

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:34.750
I place Gaia the Dragon Champion on the catapult to launch it.

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:41.050
By launching it from the catapult, Gaia the Dragon Champion's attack points increase to 3200.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:43.150
It's powerful!

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:53.450
That's pointless.  My monsters have Metal Guardian as a shield.

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:59.100
If I survive this turn, the shadows will once again block your attacks.

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:02.690
I never said anything about attacking your monsters.

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:06.190
I'm attacking the Castle!

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:13.970
You fool!  The Castle has 3200 defense points, which is equal to Gaia the Dragon Champion's attack points.

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:16.970
I won't take any damage.

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:19.470
Knock it out of the sky!

00:14:19.470 --> 00:14:22.300
Go, Gaia the Dragon Champion!

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.900
Yugi's life points!

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:53.200
He hurt himself to damage the enemy.

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.800
Bakura, how can you remain calm?

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:59.650
It's big trouble if the attack doesn't cause the Castle to fall!

00:14:59.890 --> 00:15:01.500
Yugi.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:17.200
It survived!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:21.000
Stop scaring me.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.600
You couldn't knock it down.

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:28.250
Your pointless attack only managed to knock off its levitation ring.

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:35.010
Kid, I survived your phony proclamation.

00:15:35.010 --> 00:15:38.650
I switch all my monsters to attack position.

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:41.500
They will attack you next turn.

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:44.950
This duel has ended.

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:47.030
You won't have another turn.

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:48.800
What?

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:55.270
Don't you think it's strange that the Castle is still floating even though it lost its levitation ring?

00:15:55.270 --> 00:16:01.600
What if Swords of Revealing Light trapped your castle, just like your other monsters?

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:04.840
It can't be...

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:06.110
Of course.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:10.300
Swords of Revealing Light is holding up the Castle.

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:14.290
When this turn ends, those Swords will vanish.

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:15.800
That means...

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:19.800
When Swords of Revealing Light vanishes, your Castle will fall.

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:23.850
Wait!

00:16:24.570 --> 00:16:27.100
I end my turn.

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.850
Monsters, flee!

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:38.000
They can't.  Yellow Luster Shield prevents them from escaping.

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:06.300
He did it!

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:07.500
Yugi won!

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:08.950
Awesome!

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:15.250
I can't believe I lost.

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:25.200
I don't care about the results of this duel!

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:29.200
I'm sending you to hell!

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:32.260
What?

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:35.450
This is bad!  Yugi can't move!

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:40.700
That's what you get for making a fool out of me.  Fire!

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:48.000
Yugi!

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:49.400
Yugi!

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.150
What?

00:18:01.360 --> 00:18:05.410
I'll show you the true power of the shadows.

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:07.000
Don't do it!

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:23.800
Yugi, I'm glad you're safe.

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:26.550
But what was that light?

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:31.420
I think the flames destroyed the 3-D virtual system.

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:35.850
Yugi, that was impressive.

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:37.660
Mai.

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:40.300
These Chips belongs to you.

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:45.250
What's wrong?  Take them.

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:46.830
Mai?

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:49.300
I can't accept those Star Chips.

00:18:49.300 --> 00:18:51.500
I'm leaving the island.

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:55.100
But Mai, remember what you said.

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:57.500
Your dream is to battle Yugi.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:58.550
That's...

00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:02.500
Sheesh!  There's no point talking to her!

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:07.800
If you don't want them, I'll take them.

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:13.900
Wait a sec!  I won't allow that!

00:19:13.900 --> 00:19:15.730
But you don't need them.

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:17.740
Give them back!

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.700
Here you go.

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:24.380
Jonouchi...

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:31.400
If your pride won't let you battle with those Star Chips, then throw them into the ocean.

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:33.600
The choice is yours.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:39.760
But if it was up to me, I wouldn't throw away those Chips or my dreams.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:47.950
Time to get some sleep.

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:52.200
You and your cheesy lines.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.450
Be quiet.

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:55.100
Now now.

00:19:56.310 --> 00:19:57.980
Yugi.

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:01.800
I'll borrow these Star Chips.

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:05.890
As long as I'm in your debt, I don't have the right to battle you.

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:13.390
But once I earn that right, I'll battle you fair and square.

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:14.850
Mai.

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:17.330
Okay.  I'll be waiting.

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:39.300
Sheesh, who's coming to this island via helicopter in the middle of the night?

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.850
Kaiba?

00:20:40.850 --> 00:20:45.200
Kaiba is heading to face Pegasus, but Jonouchi challenges him to a duel.

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:48.650
What?  This is the perfect opportunity to test the Duel Disk?

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:53.550
Don't lose, Jonouchi!  Show him how much stronger you've gotten on this island!

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:57.700
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Clash!  Blue-Eyes vs Red-Eyes

00:20:57.700 --> 00:20:59.650
Duel, standby!

00:21:03.230 --> 00:21:11.630
The flask glistens

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:19.480
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:28.450
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:29.150 --> 00:21:36.230
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:42.060
Shower of happiness

00:21:42.350 --> 00:21:46.170
I will shower you with it

00:21:46.500 --> 00:21:54.440
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:54.640 --> 00:21:58.680
Shower of happiness

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:02.810
You are not alone

00:22:03.190 --> 00:22:09.530
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
